 "strings": {
  "Adachi's contact info. Address: Tenkaichi Alley, Yoshikawa Building, 3F. Phone: 03-5555-4567.": "",
  "Stakeout Style": "",
  "Sunglasses and a beanie, the classic disguise for keeping a low profile.": "",
  "DVD Purchase Order": "",
  "A purchase order of a package containing a DVD to accept on behalf of Tsukumo.": "",
  "Love Star DVD": "",
  "The anime I picked up for Tsukumo. There's a cartoon girl on the box.": "",
  "Empty Trash Can": "",
  "A waste bin with no garbage in it at all. It's clean... maybe even too clean.": "",
  "Saori's Milk Carton": "",
  "Found in the kitchen. It's been cleanly washed and neatly folded.": "",
  "Notice of Power Outage": "",
  "A planned outage occurred late last night, before the incident at Genda Law Office.": "",
  "Carp Sashimi": "",
  "A photo of the fish that were made into sashimi at Koi Bride, the fishing pond. Some survived, but these carps got the short end of the shish kebab.": "",
